      "source": "Find and create <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s for properties of given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a>s\nare created for properties and types with <a href=\"QueryIndexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.index\"><code>QueryIndexed</code></a>.",
